  "details": "For some reason i am unable to play Youtube videos by myself for quite a few weeks now. No matter which world or player type i use, Youtube videos won't play for me. Videos that have been set by the world and so on are playing without a problem. If someone is in the same world when i paste a URL and try to play it, they'll see the video playing, i wont. \nAs soon as someone plays the same Video URL for me, then it loads for me and i can watch it.\nI've tried updating the Youtube-DL.exe to see if this fixes my issues, but it didnt.\nAre there users with the same issue or is it just me?",
